{"schema_version": 2, "unit_id": "tag:0BX8:statement", "parent_tag": "01RR", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003> be schemes over <MATH_0004>. Assume <MATH_0005> has\nfinitely many irreducible components with generic points\n<MATH_0006>. Let <MATH_0007> be the image of <MATH_0008>.\nConsider the map\n<MATHSEG_0001>-rational maps<MATHSEG_0002>from <MATHSEG_0003> to <MATHSEG_0004> where <MATHSEG_0005> lies over <MATHSEG_0006> and<MATHSEG_0007> is a local <MATHSEG_0008>-algebra map<MATHSEG_0009>\nwhich sends <MATH_0009> to the <MATH_0010>-tuple with\n<MATH_0011> and <MATH_0012>. Then\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0013> is locally of finite type, then the map is injective.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0014> is locally of finite presentation, then the map is bijective.\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0015> is locally of finite type and <MATH_0016> reduced,\nthen the map is bijective.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$Y$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$X$", "MATH_0006": "$x_1, \\ldots, x_n$", "MATH_0007": "$s_i \\in S$", "MATH_0008": "$x_i$", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\nS\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "} \\\\\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0003": "}X\\text{", "MATHSEG_0004": "}Y\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n(y_1, \\varphi_1, \\ldots, y_n, \\varphi_n)\\text{", "MATHSEG_0005": "}\ny_i \\in Y\\text{", "MATHSEG_0006": "}s_i\\text{", "MATHSEG_0007": "}\\\\\n\\varphi_i : \\mathcal{O}_{Y, y_i} \\to \\mathcal{O}_{X, x_i}\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0008": "}\\mathcal{O}_{S, s_i}\\text{", "MATHSEG_0009": "}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$f : U \\to Y$", "MATH_0010": "$2n$", "MATH_0011": "$y_i = f(x_i)$", "MATH_0012": "$\\varphi_i = f^\\sharp_{x_i}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "MATH_0013": "$Y \\to S$", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "MATH_0014": "$Y \\to S$", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "MATH_0015": "$Y \\to S$", "MATH_0016": "$X$", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-rational-map-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "math_text_regions": [{"region_id": "math/0001", "delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "source": "$$\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\nS\\text{-rational maps} \\\\\n\\text{from }X\\text{ to }Y\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n(y_1, \\varphi_1, \\ldots, y_n, \\varphi_n)\\text{ where }\ny_i \\in Y\\text{ lies over }s_i\\text{ and}\\\\\n\\varphi_i : \\mathcal{O}_{Y, y_i} \\to \\mathcal{O}_{X, x_i}\n\\text{ is a local }\\mathcal{O}_{S, s_i}\\text{-algebra map}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n$$", "source_hash": "sha256:c0ed983c1de6ed5a06310534f308bd2d6b80cae75270aafab25688cc8e11137d", "source_byte_span": {"start": 267, "end": 646}, "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0002"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0002"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0003"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0003"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0004"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0004"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0005"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0005"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0006"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0006"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0007"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0007"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0008"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0008"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0009"}], "slots": [{"slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001", "source": "-rational maps", "command": "text", "policy_entry